**What the unit measures.** A severity-dependent evidence bar, with independence counted from distinct live SHA-256 identities (not caller-supplied family/class labels):

| Severity | Bar |
|---|---|
| P0 | 3 identities, 3 classes, primary, executable, both-states |
| P1 | 2 identities, 2 classes, primary, executable if machine-testable |
| P2 | 2 identities, ≥1 class |
| P3 | 1 identity, 1 class |

Nobody may lower the bar and still call a claim verified. Humans may record a scoped, expiring exception; the claim stays BELOW-BAR.

